sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant GW as Upstream Gateway<br/>(kube-rbac-proxy)
    participant Orch as Orchestrator<br/>8033/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Chunker as Chunker Service<br/>8085/TCP gRPC
    participant Detector as Detector Service(s)<br/>8080/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant GenSvc as Generation Service<br/>(TGIS/NLP/OpenAI)

    Note over Client,GenSvc: Flow 1: Unary Chat Completions with Detection

    Client->>GW: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    GW->>Orch: Forward request<br/>X-Forwarded-Access-Token → Bearer rewrite

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over Orch,Detector: Input Detection Phase
        Orch->>Chunker: ChunkerTokenizationTaskPredict<br/>gRPC, TLS/mTLS
        Chunker-->>Orch: Chunked text segments
        Orch->>Detector: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Optional Bearer
        Detector-->>Orch: Detection results (HAP, PII, etc.)
    end

    alt Input passes detection
        rect rgb(224, 247, 224)
            Note over Orch,GenSvc: Generation Phase
            Orch->>GenSvc: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTP/HTTPS or gRPC
            GenSvc-->>Orch: Generated completion
        end

        rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
            Note over Orch,Detector: Output Detection Phase
            Orch->>Chunker: ChunkerTokenizationTaskPredict<br/>gRPC, TLS/mTLS
            Chunker-->>Orch: Chunked output segments
            Orch->>Detector: POST /api/v1/text/generation<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Optional Bearer
            Detector-->>Orch: Output detection results
        end
    else Input blocked by detector
        Orch-->>Client: 200 OK with detection warnings<br/>(no generation performed)
    end

    Orch-->>GW: JSON Response with detections
    GW-->>Client: Response

    Note over Client,GenSvc: Flow 2: Streaming Generation with Classification

    Client->>GW: POST /api/v1/task/server-streaming-classification-with-text-generation
    GW->>Orch: Forward request

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over Orch,Detector: Input Detection
        Orch->>Detector: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Input classification
        Detector-->>Orch: Input detection results
    end

    alt Input passes
        rect rgb(224, 247, 224)
            Note over Orch,GenSvc: Concurrent Streaming
            par Streaming Generation
                Orch->>GenSvc: GenerateStream (gRPC)<br/>8033/TCP or 8085/TCP, mTLS
                GenSvc-->>Orch: Stream of generated tokens
            and Concurrent Chunking
                Orch->>Chunker: BidiStreamingChunkerTokenizationTaskPredict<br/>gRPC bidi stream, TLS/mTLS
                Chunker-->>Orch: Chunked token batches
            and Concurrent Detection
                Orch->>Detector: POST /api/v1/text/generation<br/>Detection on chunked output
                Detector-->>Orch: Streaming detection results
            end
        end

        loop DetectionBatcherManager (tokio::select!)
            Orch-->>Client: SSE/ND-JSON stream<br/>tokens + attached detections
        end
    end
